---
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1>A long-term home for the software business you've built.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        We buy important software businesses from great founders and hold them
        for the long term, making sure they have the team and investment needed
        to keep serving customers well.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
      </p>
      <p class="origin small muted">
        Kura (蔵), pronounced "koo-rah," is Japanese for storehouse: a place
        where valuable things are kept.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse at top left,
        rgba(33, 158, 188, 0.18),
        transparent 55%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse at bottom right,
        rgba(251, 133, 0, 0.1),
        transparent 60%
      ),
      var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero .lead {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero .origin {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
</style>
